id = &"bellows_kin"
display_name = "Bellows Kin"
shared_traits = "The families who kept the old machines running after the city above forgot them. Tall and thin, they stand very straight; long tailored coats with a row of brass buttons; heavy leather aprons for the workshops; many wear brass prosthetics they built themselves. The family signature is a round verdigris-green lens (monocle or goggle) that catches the gaslight."
